    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autumn is slowly coming to an end. You (a little mouse) must leave your hole and begin to pile up winter-supplies. Other animals, all living in a small garden besides a big house, might help you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse's move-set to reach interesting places. Jumping, Diving, Groundpounding and Climbing are all part of your move-set.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an autumn-themed garden as a little mouse. Jump around the place, run and climb into every corner, and find different collectibles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different animals will give you missions to complete, that are richly rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autumn is slowly coming to an end. You (a little mouse) must leave your hole and begin to pile up winter-supplies. Other animals, all living in a small garden besides a big house, might help you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse's move-set to reach interesting places. Jumping, Diving, Groundpounding and Climbing are all part of your move-set.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an autumn-themed garden as a little mouse. Jump around the place, run and climb into every corner, and find different collectibles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Missions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different animals will give you missions to complete, that are richly rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
